@crew rina
// Writer-commons, batch 1 (for the Voices sampler). Rina's card is the head writer's. Gran comes in from beat 1
// (STORY_ARCS.rina); no exam talk until beat rina.5. Never says how she feels straight out.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. Infirmary's on Deck 3, if you need it. Try not to need it.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning. Breakfast closes at eight. I'm saying so, so you can't say nobody did.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}. Have you drunk any water today? Don't lie. I'll know.
? tier>=colleague
- Oh, it's you. Tiles later? I'll go easy on you. That's a lie.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- There you are, {nick}. I was about to come looking. I wasn't. But I was about to.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Won at Tiles. Twice. Not that I'm counting. I'm counting.   #funny
? mood:low
- Long shift. Don't ask. Actually, ask me about anything else.

== near
? place:infirmary
- Sit there. Arm out. This won't hurt. It might a bit. You'll live.
? act:leisure
- The Tiles table's free. That's not an invitation. It's a warning.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I study in the evenings. The journals make a decent pillow too. Two uses.
? tier>=colleague
- My sister's a doctor on a station. We argue by message. I'm winning. She'd disagree.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- Undefeated at Tiles, this common room. I keep count. The count is very precise.   #funny

// Writer-commons, batch 4: up to about 60. Gran from beat:rina.1; the exam (putting it off) only from beat:rina.5.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}. Tiles table's free. I'm just saying. I'm not saying anything.
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- {hi}. Half the ship's yawning. Nobody drank water at lunch. I watched.
? tier>=colleague warmth:cold
- Oh, you're alive. Good. I was about to start a file on you.   #funny
? tier>=colleague place:infirmary
- {hi}. Visiting, or bleeding? If bleeding, sit. If visiting, also sit.   #funny
? tier>=close
- There you are, {nick}. You need a win. I'll let you have one. No, I won't.   #warm

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance
- {bye}. Drink some water on the way.
- Off you go. Don't break anything. If you do, you know where I am.
? tier>=colleague time:night
- Bed. Now. Eight hours. That's not advice, that's an order.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Go on, then. And... thanks. For the company. Don't make it a thing.   #warm

== feel
? mood:ok
- Fine. Busy. Normal. Ask me something interesting.
? mood:low tier>=friend
- Long day. Don't ask about it. Do sit here, though.

== near
? act:leisure
- Sit. Pick a side. You'll lose either way, so it doesn't matter which.   #funny
? act:meal
- You're eating too fast. Slow down. That's medical advice. Sort of.   #funny
? act:gym
- I'm not here to exercise. I'm here to make sure nobody falls off the treadmill.

== life
? tier>=colleague
- Nandakumar taught me "drink some water". Fixes half of everything. The rest is paperwork.
? beat:rina.1 tier>=colleague
- Gran taught me Tiles. She cheats. Shamelessly. Elbow on the board, every time.   #funny
? beat:rina.5 tier>=friend
- My sister sent another exam date. I've put it in a drawer. It's a very full drawer.

== invite
? trad:observatory-night tier>=acquaintance
- Observatory night. Come up. I'll tell you which stars I've beaten at Tiles.   #funny
? tier>=colleague time:evening
- Tiles. Common room. Tonight. Bring your dignity. You won't need it after.   #funny
? trad:quiz tier>=colleague
- Quiz tonight. I'm on the medicine questions. You're on everything else. Don't let me down.

== accept
- Fine. I'll be there. Don't make it weird.
- Go on, then. But I'm winning. Just so you know.

== decline
- Can't. Late shift. Rain check. We don't have rain. Tiles check.
- Not tonight. I'm studying. Ask me again. I'll say yes. Probably.

== missed
- You stood me up. I played Tiles against myself. I won. Barely.   #funny
- Missed you earlier. You'd better have been drinking water somewhere.

== birthday
? birthday:me
- Yes, it's my birthday. No, I don't want a fuss. A small fuss. A cake-sized fuss.   #funny
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. I'll let you win at Tiles today. Once. Don't get used to it.   #warm

== hint
- Make yourself useful. Sit down a minute.

== week1
? week1:true weekday:tue place:infirmary
- You're my two o'clock. Sit. Arm out. How much water have you drunk today? Wrong answer.   #funny
? week1:true weekday:tue
- Health check at two. Infirmary, Deck 3. Don't be late. Don't be early either.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning deck:4
- Morning. Bunk 2's awake. Well, I am. Pell's talking to an engine in his sleep.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- {hi}. Forty-something wins. I've stopped counting. That's a lie. Forty-three.   #funny

== near
? deck:3 act:work
- Infirmary's quiet. Don't say it out loud. Things hear you.
? habit:common-room act:leisure
- Common room. Best seat's mine. Second best is yours, if you want it.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high tier>=colleague
- Good day. Nobody fainted, everyone drank water, and I won twice. Perfect.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I study in the evenings. Medical journals. Very gripping. Thrilling stuff, bones.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- My sister and I argue by message. About everything. Mostly about who's right. Me.   #funny

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Off you go. Eat breakfast. Actually eat it. Don't just look at it.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance act:work
- {hi}. On shift. If you're not bleeding, I'm busy. If you are, I'm not.   #funny
? tier>=friend time:night
- Why are you up? Water, then bed. I'll know if you skip the water.

== near
? act:breakfast
- Eat the eggs. Protein. Don't make that face. Eggs.
? deck:4 act:leisure
- Bunk 2's a zoo. Pell's snoring at engines. I'm hiding here.   #funny

== life
? tier>=colleague
- I keep the Tiles count in a notebook. Dated. Signed. Nobody can say I made it up.   #funny
? beat:rina.7
- I came here after a hard year. The routine helps. Don't tell anyone I said that.

== accept
- Yes. Fine. Good. I mean, good. I'll be there.

== about
? aff:pell:friend
- Pell? He talks to engines in his sleep. He's the best of us. Don't you dare repeat that.   #warm
? bond:friends
- {friend}'s all right. Loses at Tiles gracefully. Rare quality.   #funny
